@startuml
[*] --> UserUnauthenticated
UserUnauthenticated -> LoggedIn : after successful login
LoggedIn -> LocationInput : enter location
LocationInput -> ValidLocation : valid entry
ValidLocation -> WeatherCheck : check weather
WeatherCheck -> AdditionalDetails : view more details (optional)
AdditionalDetails -> EndSession : log out
EndSession --> [*]
@enduml
